# Golden run of Brakes.dll's ТСКБМ (PB_SETUP 4) on a six-car
# ЭД9М (G M P M MR GR), docs/brakes-dll-replacement.md "The rest", stage 2:
# its switch (45) on, the train off to about 40 km/h and then left alone,
# no switch moved: its timer runs down from 100 s, L2 (53) blinks under
# 15 s, the whistle and the request under 7, at 0 the ЭПК vents and the
# train stops; the РБС (22) answers it and its timer starts again. Then
# on the move a switch moved (the 395, 2) starts it again too; at a stand
# under 7 s it waits at 6.9. The ЭПК key 26, the РБ 23; the 395 switch 2
# (II 1, III 2), the controller 0 (5 zero, 7 the first notch), the
# reverser 1. RTS's air.
#
#   openrts-train-check <RTS root> --dll mdd_ED9M-0060 mdd_ED9M-0060_G mdd_ED9M-0060_M mdd_ED9M-0060_P
#       mdd_ED9M-0060_M mdd_ED9M-0060_MR mdd_ED9M-0060_GR --script tests/data/golden/ed9m_tskbm.script
#       --klub shadow
0    voltage 25000 50
0    line_limit 120
0    line_signal S1 9000 7
0    line_signal S2 18000 7
1    switch 2 1
# ТСКБМ on (its switch, ТСКБМ's own: no periodic vigilance of the КЛУБ).
2    switch 45 1
# Off to about 40 km/h, then coasting; nothing touched for 110 s.
20   switch 1 3
21   switch 0 5
23   switch 0 7
44   switch 0 5
# Its ЭПК vented the pipe (about 44 + 100 s): the РБС answers once standing.
175  switch 22 1
176  switch 22 0
# II again; off again, then the 395 moved (III, II) at about 60 s left.
180  switch 2 1
190  switch 0 7
205  switch 0 5
236  switch 2 2
237  switch 2 1
# Standing under 7 s: it waits at 6.9.
300  switch 2 2
340  switch 2 1
